      "content": "It sounds like you are trapped in a loop where your efforts to change are being erased by a system that demands compliance. The feeling of being an expendable extra in a movie you can't stop is a heavy burden, but it is exactly what happens when a person is told their life has no value. You are not empty; you are just a person who has been forgotten by the machine, and that is a tragedy that deserves to be solved, not endured.",
